.png", "id": "1046149778065944", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1046149784732610_8880066746435582030_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mKhOZTsA6NUQ7kNvwHXIXQt&_nc_oc=AdrpTwDD_W42Jk34XN2_qXn2OpFydUNhJw53j5tIGQ1vR_KP5JVfM6im0bubR8waKlA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLIWlIBnGdIjUAMxTemXW0AC68242zpYFiKxQu2fMitTQ&oe=6A9AE95C"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "920597623641285", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_920597626974618_2521043253492521848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AFu1bAi0R-0Q7kNvwFfwwNR&_nc_oc=AdrZYIDzOF8m8Uk1E-Nr9_qETmdESOK2I43jfDUkeNz9qQmvvAR7PO4au-v1AskCEVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKaJ11mpqxQMoNDkM9I2t-X_Ej7fRAZRnfbC4L6JMTF_A&oe=6A9AE862"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "27320343750994458", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_27320343784327788_1105610351429079997_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n_iY7utOoqwQ7kNvwGEoQQ6&_nc_oc=AdphnXtYu1S6vMOW8BB4ZCa_0d0WmXDbZRuekGWkhBfxIECXl0bXyqgTuQfRLnXoxxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIeD9gNqn_LJ4MlzSh9W8Yx0Tx0wi2MUuSmKLMf4Rbf_Q&oe=6A9AD277"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cycle X: Bicycle Game Simulator", "keywords": ["Cycle", "Bicycle", "Motocross", "BMX", "Bike"], "long_description": "Experience immersive bicycle riding in VR with **Cycle X VR**! Take control of your bike and explore exciting environments while mastering realistic movement, precise steering, challenging routes, and obstacle-filled tracks.\n\nRide through **mountain trails**, discover immersive **forest paths**, and navigate detailed **city environments**. Each location offers a different cycling experience, from winding mountain routes and natural forest trails to urban streets where your riding skills are put to the test.\n\nLooking for a precision challenge? Enter **Parking Mode** and maneuver your bicycle through tight spaces, challenging paths, and tricky parking areas. Carefully control your bike, follow the route, avoid obstacles, and aim for the perfect park.\n\n### \ud83d\udeb4 Explore Different Environments\n\n\u2022 **Mountain Mode** \u2013 Ride through challenging mountain terrain and winding trails.\n\u2022 **Forest Mode** \u2013 Explore natural forest paths filled with obstacles and challenging routes.\n\u2022 **City Mode** \u2013 Ride through urban environments and test your control on city streets.\n\u2022 **Parking Mode** \u2013 Master precision riding and park your bicycle in challenging spaces.\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Built for VR\n\nExperience bicycle riding from an immersive first-person VR perspective with intuitive controller-based controls. Steer, navigate, balance, avoid obstacles, and improve your riding skills as you take on new challenges.\n\nWhether you enjoy **VR cycling, bicycle riding, exploration, obstacle courses, or precision parking**", "short_description": "Master the ride in Cycle X VR! Explore mountain trails, forests, and city streets on a realistic bicycle, then test your precision in challenging parking levels. Ride, navigate, balance, and park your way through immersive VR cycling adventures!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": nul